{"r0": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreTheme/197865931134", "t0": [{"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Envío a España peninsular y Baleares · Pago seguro · Devolución en 14 días (botella cerrada)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "97cafaf76ebf376abf110a1f8e5c488c3fae1c17639021f8e531b95fcf34040f"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>Tu pedido sale de París con Chronopost y se entrega en España peninsular y Baleares en 2 a 3 días laborables. Los gastos se muestran en la cesta, antes del pago.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2655e012052e68863e436ac44c3be79eb91fedf0bfa9dbc7515a47d6a388dcf9"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.hero_DdhBcH.group_iCr8Rp__text_sub.text:2dupizbe34we4", "value": "<p>Virgen extra, de cosecha temprana, prensado en frío. Enviado desde París, en 2 a 3 días.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a23ba7f9efac775bff886b654784c5fbf8d76017323ace794dea709e565ceb72"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, en 2 a 3 días laborables.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "700d146a6b2e01350fac6d1fb533af68d3d805f149a263fd2bd2e4c9c10f95a3"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Enviado desde París</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "2b1009358558021cf4fb3fff5899519eb876326f3bf3699e7ab98b4dddc6c490"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Enviamos desde París con Chronopost. España peninsular y Baleares: entrega en 2 a 3 días laborables.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "03a1502bbf6b563eb9d993f993dd9941e7355e0281aac3e9efd6a76e53c4f03f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Envio para Portugal · Pagamento seguro · Devolução em 14 dias (garrafa fechada)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "97cafaf76ebf376abf110a1f8e5c488c3fae1c17639021f8e531b95fcf34040f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>A sua encomenda sai de Paris com Chronopost e é entregue em Portugal em 2 a 3 dias úteis. Os portes são apresentados no carrinho, antes do pagamento.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2655e012052e68863e436ac44c3be79eb91fedf0bfa9dbc7515a47d6a388dcf9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.hero_DdhBcH.group_iCr8Rp__text_sub.text:2dupizbe34we4", "value": "<p>Virgem extra, colheita precoce, prensado a frio. Enviado a partir de Paris, em 2 a 3 dias.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a23ba7f9efac775bff886b654784c5fbf8d76017323ace794dea709e565ceb72"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, em 2 a 3 dias úteis.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "700d146a6b2e01350fac6d1fb533af68d3d805f149a263fd2bd2e4c9c10f95a3"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Enviado a partir de Paris</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "2b1009358558021cf4fb3fff5899519eb876326f3bf3699e7ab98b4dddc6c490"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Enviamos a partir de Paris com Chronopost. Para Portugal: entrega em 2 a 3 dias úteis.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "03a1502bbf6b563eb9d993f993dd9941e7355e0281aac3e9efd6a76e53c4f03f"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Spedizione in Italia · Pagamento sicuro · Reso entro 14 giorni (bottiglia chiusa)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "97cafaf76ebf376abf110a1f8e5c488c3fae1c17639021f8e531b95fcf34040f"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>Il tuo ordine parte da Parigi con Chronopost e viene consegnato in Italia in 2-3 giorni lavorativi. Le spese sono indicate nel carrello, prima del pagamento.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2655e012052e68863e436ac44c3be79eb91fedf0bfa9dbc7515a47d6a388dcf9"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.index.json.hero_DdhBcH.group_iCr8Rp__text_sub.text:2dupizbe34we4", "value": "<p>Extravergine, raccolta precoce, spremuto a freddo. Spedito da Parigi, in 2-3 giorni.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a23ba7f9efac775bff886b654784c5fbf8d76017323ace794dea709e565ceb72"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, in 2-3 giorni lavorativi.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "700d146a6b2e01350fac6d1fb533af68d3d805f149a263fd2bd2e4c9c10f95a3"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Spedito da Parigi</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "2b1009358558021cf4fb3fff5899519eb876326f3bf3699e7ab98b4dddc6c490"}, {"locale": "it", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Spediamo da Parigi con Chronopost. Italia: consegna in 2-3 giorni lavorativi.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "03a1502bbf6b563eb9d993f993dd9941e7355e0281aac3e9efd6a76e53c4f03f"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Levering in België · Veilig betalen · Retour binnen 14 dagen (ongeopende fles)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "97cafaf76ebf376abf110a1f8e5c488c3fae1c17639021f8e531b95fcf34040f"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>Uw bestelling vertrekt vanuit Parijs met Chronopost en wordt in België geleverd in 2 tot 3 werkdagen. De verzendkosten ziet u in het winkelmandje, vóór de betaling.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2655e012052e68863e436ac44c3be79eb91fedf0bfa9dbc7515a47d6a388dcf9"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.index.json.hero_DdhBcH.group_iCr8Rp__text_sub.text:2dupizbe34we4", "value": "<p>Extra vierge, vroeg geoogst, koudgeperst. Verzonden vanuit Parijs, in 2 tot 3 dagen.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a23ba7f9efac775bff886b654784c5fbf8d76017323ace794dea709e565ceb72"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, in 2 tot 3 werkdagen.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "700d146a6b2e01350fac6d1fb533af68d3d805f149a263fd2bd2e4c9c10f95a3"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Verzonden vanuit Parijs</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "2b1009358558021cf4fb3fff5899519eb876326f3bf3699e7ab98b4dddc6c490"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Wij verzenden vanuit Parijs met Chronopost. België: levering in 2 tot 3 werkdagen.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "03a1502bbf6b563eb9d993f993dd9941e7355e0281aac3e9efd6a76e53c4f03f"}]}